# Unified Document Branding — Sector Color System

**ALL DDI documents use the same sector color system. One glance tells you what service lane the document is for.**

---

## THE RULE

Every document generated by NEXUS — RFQ, Capability Statement, Quote Response, Invoice, Letter, Proposal — uses colors based on the **service lane/sector**.

This applies to:
- ✅ RFQs (to suppliers)
- ✅ Capability Statements (to buyers)
- ✅ Quote Responses (to buyers)
- ✅ Invoices (to clients)
- ✅ Formal Letters
- ✅ Proposals
- ✅ Subcontractor Agreements

