## WHERE COLORS APPLY

### Header
- Background: `primary`
- Badge/Tag: `secondary`
- Text: White

### Meta Strip / Info Bar
- Background: `accent_bg`
- Border: Matches sector

### Section Headers
- Background: `primary`
- Text: White

### Tables
- Header row: `table_header`
- Alternating rows: `accent_bg`
- Qty/Amount text: `secondary`

### Numbered Lists
- Circle background: `table_header`
- Number text: White

### Buttons / CTAs
- Background: `secondary`
- Border: `table_header`
- Text: White

### Footer
- Background: `primary`
- Text: Light (sector-appropriate)

