## HOW TO USE IN GENERATORS

### Python Generator Pattern

```python
SECTOR_COLORS = {
    'fingerprinting': {'primary': '#1a2e1a', 'secondary': '#2d5016', ...},
    'drug_testing': {'primary': '#3b0764', 'secondary': '#7c3aed', ...},
    # ... all sectors
}

def get_sector_colors(sector):
    return SECTOR_COLORS.get(sector.lower(), SECTOR_COLORS['default'])

def generate_document(config):
    sector = config.get('sector', 'default')
    colors = get_sector_colors(sector)
    # Use colors['primary'], colors['secondary'], etc. in HTML
```

### JSON Config Pattern

```json
{
  "sector": "drug_testing",
  "rfq": {
    "number": "DDI-2026-DTS001",
    "title": "17-Panel Drug Test Cups"
  }
}
```

